@startuml session_snapshot_state_model
title Session State Layers and CampusClaw Target Model

' Source evidence (pi-mono 086c32e74530564922d011ade23ff582c9d63116):
' packages/protocol/src/schemas.ts, SessionSnapshotSchema, lines 241-258
' packages/protocol/src/schemas.ts, TranscriptItemSchema and TranscriptProgressSchema, lines 120-231
' packages/server/src/sessions.ts, normalizedSnapshot and broadcastSnapshot, lines 276-297
' packages/agent/src/harness/agent-harness.ts, SuspendedOperation, LaneSnapshot, and SessionSnapshot, lines 140-180
' packages/agent/src/harness/session/types.ts, operation, tool, queue, and deferred write records, lines 87-200
' packages/agent/src/harness/reducer.ts, LaneState, lines 79-109
' Source evidence (pi-mono-java dff835743fc7f3c93e1154c3eb51028749867ca8):
' modules/agent-core/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/agent/state/AgentStateSnapshot.java, lines 21-36
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/session/SessionManager.java, lines 160-225 and 304-339
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/mode/server/SessionPool.java, lines 222-243
' modules/coding-agent-cli/src/main/java/com/campusclaw/codingagent/mode/server/ChatWebSocketHandler.java, handleGetState, lines 365-374
' Observed behavior: pi-mono exposes a client-replaceable snapshot with transcript, runtime
' phase, revision, and queued steer messages.
' Observed behavior: pi-mono durable records retain richer operation, queue, deferred write,
' and tool recovery state than the public protocol snapshot.
' Java divergence: AgentStateSnapshot is process-local, while Java session reload restores
' messages but does not apply persisted model or thinking changes.
' Target design: CampusClaw separates the bounded Session aggregate, owned history records,
' the private RuntimeCheckpoint, and the public GetSession snapshot.
' Architecture change: cross-process active Run recovery requires a durable checkpoint or
' equivalent operation log; this is not implemented by the current Java baseline.
' Design reason: the confirmed create response remains separate from the proposed GET snapshot
' so review of the second operation cannot silently change the first operation.

top to bottom direction
